WEBVTT

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:17.640
Three people. One slice. Classic scenario. What to do. What to do. I mean, nobody wants to be the one to take the last slice.

00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:23.780
You look at what?

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:48.384
I hope you save room.

00:00:54.144 --> 00:00:57.170
Let me get yours, Porky. I still feel bad about you losing your job.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:01.330
Oh, no, it&#x27;s okay. I got a new job. I&#x27;m doing catering.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:12.670
Catering? Nobody wants a pig handling their food. Besides, isn&#x27;t that a lot of temptation? I mean, your name&#x27;s not Health and Fitness Pig. It&#x27;s Porky Pig. Am I right?

00:01:15.776 --> 00:01:18.290
Couldn&#x27;t you at least pretend to reach for your wallet?

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:22.510
I don&#x27;t have a wallet. Besides, I shouldn&#x27;t have to pay. It&#x27;s my birthday.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.730
Your birthday&#x27;s not until next week.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:27.970
Oh, we&#x27;re well within the birthday zone.

00:01:30.816 --> 00:01:31.300
It&#x27;s Lola.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.160
Hey, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Slow down.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:35.980
Lola, calm down.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.380
Lola, stop. I can&#x27;t understand.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:39.960
Where are you?

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.540
Where are you?

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.720
Okay, I&#x27;m coming.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:44.620
I gotta go.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.060
Lola broke her leg.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:46.760
Oh, dear.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.200
Poor Lola.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:49.700
Don&#x27;t feel bad for her.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.580
You&#x27;re the one who got stuck with a bill.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:52.704
Am I right?

00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:56.610
You guys are too sensitive.

00:02:08.064 --> 00:02:08.300
What are you doing here?

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.479
You called me.

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:10.840
You were hysterical.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.020
Oh, right.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.000
It&#x27;s a simple fracture.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.300
She&#x27;ll have the cast off in about six weeks.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:18.400
How did it happen?

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.220
It&#x27;s crazy.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.020
I was out buying cupcakes when I noticed a baby stuck on top of a building.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.520
I knew I had to save that baby.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:33.080
So I finished my cupcake and shimmied up the drainpipe when suddenly the drainpipe started coming loose from the building.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.780
And you fell and broke your leg?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:35.200
No.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:40.020
I let go of the drainpipe just in time and grabbed hold of a telephone wire.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.320
So there I was, hanging from the wire.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:48.060
I started swinging myself back and forth until finally I flung myself as high as I could, hoping I would make it to the roof.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.600
But I didn&#x27;t make it to the roof.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:53.980
I was totally out of control and I went crashing through a giant plate glass window.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.020
And that&#x27;s when you broke your leg?

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:56.600
No.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.440
I landed flat on my back in the middle of some girl&#x27;s apartment.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.800
She was super sweet.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.120
We&#x27;re totally having lunch next week.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.380
Anyway, I found my way to the elevator, but it was out of service.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:09.960
So I had to pry open the doors and throw myself into the elevator shaft.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.200
You fell down an elevator shaft?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.520
Will you please just listen?

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:15.640
I caught the elevator cables.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:24.000
I pulled myself up hand over hand until I finally reached the top where I kicked the grate open with my feet and catapulted myself onto the roof.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.940
But right before I could grab the baby, it turned and I realized it wasn&#x27;t a baby.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.860
It was a crow.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.960
And it attacked me.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:32.600
What?

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.900
I tried to fend it off, but he was one of those angry crows and no matter what I did, he kept attacking.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:44.540
He wouldn&#x27;t stop and he just kept attacking and attacking until finally I lost my balance and fell 15 stories.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.640
And that when you broke your leg?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:47.260
No.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:50.220
I landed on an inflatable gorilla in front of a car dealership.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.960
So how did you break your leg?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.740
Oh, I was here for a checkup and I slipped getting up on this table.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.020
It&#x27;s really high.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:57.900
You should try it.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:58.940
No, wait, don&#x27;t.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:03:59.860
You&#x27;ll break your leg.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:00.780
Like me.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.420
She&#x27;s a keeper.

00:04:06.944 --> 00:04:07.710
What are we doing here?

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.370
I&#x27;m dropping you off.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.790
Pugs isn&#x27;t here.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.070
How am I supposed to get inside?

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:13.350
Here&#x27;s your keys.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.450
I don&#x27;t have keys.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.950
So you don&#x27;t have a wallet or keys?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.630
Porky, I&#x27;m a spiritual being.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:23.296
I&#x27;m not interested in material possessions.

00:04:25.248 --> 00:04:26.208
Ooh, can I have these?

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.480
Just take me to your house.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.760
Um, uh, can&#x27;t I drop you off at Tina&#x27;s?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:32.820
Tina&#x27;s at work.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.460
Why don&#x27;t you want to take me to your house?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:36.420
Uh, no, no.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.380
It&#x27;s just...

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.540
It&#x27;s just what?

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:39.500
Oh, nothing.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.080
I&#x27;m...

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:40.700
You&#x27;re what?

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.140
What are you up to?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.520
What are you hiding?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.704
In-in-in nothing.

00:04:46.784 --> 00:04:47.160
Aha!

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.100
You were hiding these.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:55.610
All I&#x27;m saying is you need to be charming to do catering.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.270
You&#x27;re not charming.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:58.970
Just go watch TV.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:01.030
Uh, I&#x27;ve got something cooking to do.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:01.570
Tch.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:02.750
Catering.

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.870
You should get a job where you don&#x27;t have to interact with people.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.030
Maybe something with a computer where people don&#x27;t have to look at you.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.656
That&#x27;d be good for you.

00:05:11.712 --> 00:05:14.630
Because you&#x27;re a creepy recluse who keeps to himself.

00:05:16.864 --> 00:05:18.940
...news in the case of the suburban strangler.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.360
Until now, the police have had little to go on

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:26.840
other than the assumption that the killer is a creepy recluse who keeps to himself.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:27.520
Huh.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.380
That&#x27;s how I just described Porky.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.360
But now a witness has come forward,

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.200
giving police a physical description of the suspect.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.880
The guy we&#x27;re looking for is chubby, short, and bald, with a pig-like nose.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:44.460
Chubby, short, and bald, with a pig-like nose?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:48.920
If you see anyone matching this description, call 911.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:49.312
What happened?

00:06:13.728 --> 00:06:13.984
Where am I?

00:06:17.824 --> 00:06:18.560
I&#x27;m in Porky&#x27;s house.

00:06:23.648 --> 00:06:24.960
Porky&#x27;s the suburban strangler!

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.240
I gotta call 911.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:28.980
Ah, I don&#x27;t remember the number for 911.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:30.100
Think.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:31.420
Think, man.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:32.440
I know.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.560
I&#x27;ll call 411 and ask them for the number for 911.

00:06:37.408 --> 00:06:38.220
I know the number for 411.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.560
I&#x27;ll call Bugs.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.752
He&#x27;s filled with useless information like emergency phone numbers.

00:06:48.832 --> 00:06:50.080
He cut the phone line.

00:06:55.328 --> 00:06:56.120
You scared me.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.220
Not that you&#x27;re scary.

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:59.640
I just didn&#x27;t expect you to be standing there like a psychopath.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:00.780
Not that you&#x27;re a psychopath.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.600
Are you feeling better?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:03.320
Mm-hmm.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.000
Much better.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.080
All better, in fact.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.860
I should probably be getting home.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.720
I&#x27;m sure Bugs is back by now.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.900
Oh, okay.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:10.880
I&#x27;ll drive you.

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:10.880
Wait.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.700
They say never let your attacker take you to a second location.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:15.920
What?

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:19.780
If you drive me to my house, you&#x27;d be taking me to a second location.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:20.560
So?

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.120
Nice try, Chubby.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.940
But you&#x27;re not taking me anywhere.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.480
You think I&#x27;m Chubby?

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.040
You&#x27;re not just Chubby.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.360
You&#x27;re Chubby, short, and bald.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.940
With a pig-like nose.

00:07:33.504 --> 00:07:34.000
Rude.

00:07:33.504 --> 00:07:32.192
Ah!

00:07:36.064 --> 00:07:37.820
Awfully sensitive for a wanted killer.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:40.780
Thanks for getting all my stuff.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.500
I really feel like I&#x27;m at home.

00:07:44.864 --> 00:07:46.970
Remind me again why you&#x27;re not at home?

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.350
Because you&#x27;re taking care of me, and you live here.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:50.930
See?

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:51.730
I&#x27;m doing you a favor.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.150
Gee, thanks.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:54.656
You won&#x27;t even know I&#x27;m here.

00:07:57.056 --> 00:07:57.690
Oh, Bugs?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:58.810
Yes?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.730
Mm, I&#x27;m kind of thirsty.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.424
Would you mind getting me a glass of milk?

00:08:04.832 --> 00:08:05.220
Milk.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.560
Oh, no, wait.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.620
I&#x27;m allergic to milk.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:08.780
How about a soda?

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:09.880
Diet soda, though.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:10.620
Oh, no, wait.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:11.360
Regular soda.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:12.260
I need the calories.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:13.800
You know what?

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:14.360
Sorry.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.340
Soda&#x27;s bad for you.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.520
How about an orange juice?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:17.020
No.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:17.620
Wait.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:18.520
Apple juice.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.080
No.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.040
Orange juice.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:20.540
No.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:21.200
Apple juice.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:21.820
You know what?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.600
Just give me the milk, and we&#x27;ll see what happens.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.000
What&#x27;s that?

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:25.780
Water.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:26.560
Oh!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:27.760
It&#x27;s just what I wanted.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:33.568
I gotta pee.

00:08:41.568 --> 00:08:43.159
When do you get your cast off again?

00:08:43.539 --> 00:08:44.700
Only six weeks.

00:09:11.712 --> 00:09:12.280
Can it be bed?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.160
Embroidered pillows?

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.900
Lace curtains?

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.980
This is either the bedroom of an 80-year-old woman, or a deranged killer.

00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:24.960
No knives.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:25.620
No guns.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:26.680
No body parts.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.280
Great day in the morning.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.900
How many sunglasses does one pig need?

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.560
Is it possible that Porky&#x27;s not the suburban strangler?

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.220
Could it be that he just happens to be chubby, short, and bald?

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:45.536
And I&#x27;m jumping to an outlandish conclusion because I&#x27;m a paranoid, hateful, fear-mongerer?

00:09:49.568 --> 00:09:50.816
No, that&#x27;s the face of a killer.

00:10:08.928 --> 00:10:09.220
It&#x27;s me.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.760
It has to be tonight.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.460
I think he&#x27;s on to me.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.960
Come pick up Daffy when I&#x27;m done with him.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.760
He&#x27;ll be in the garage.

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.300
In the freezer.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:24.490
What is all this?

00:10:44.512 --> 00:10:44.750
Nowhere.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.530
I was just getting a little hungry.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:47.810
Let me make you something.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:48.670
How about a sandwich?

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.390
Oh, why, thank you.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.070
I would love a sandwich.

00:10:59.392 --> 00:11:00.090
He&#x27;s toying with me.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.810
He&#x27;s gonna chop me up into a million pieces.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.190
He&#x27;s gonna cook me.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.470
He&#x27;s gonna wear me.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:06.830
Wait a minute.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.170
Calm down.

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:10.690
This is Porky you&#x27;re talking about.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.690
You&#x27;ve known him your whole life.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.470
He wouldn&#x27;t hurt a fly.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.010
He&#x27;s a sweetheart.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:18.120
Oh, no.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.120
I&#x27;ve got Stockholm Syndrome.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.720
I&#x27;ve fallen in love with my captor.

00:11:23.936 --> 00:11:24.930
It&#x27;s a chopped liver.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:25.568
Who?

00:11:26.816 --> 00:11:27.060
What?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.150
You know what?

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:37.310
I just realized I&#x27;m not hungry.

00:11:40.544 --> 00:11:42.010
I think I should slide back down.

00:12:11.776 --> 00:12:12.760
Is this not the bathroom?

00:12:11.776 --> 00:11:51.744
Sorry.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:13.920
My mistake.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.620
I thought this was the bathroom.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:16.620
Do not.

00:12:18.944 --> 00:12:20.160
I wouldn&#x27;t dream of it.

00:12:21.856 --> 00:12:23.000
If you&#x27;ll excuse me.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.056
I have some business to attend to.

00:12:28.544 --> 00:12:30.630
I have some business to attend to.

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.930
That&#x27;s what a killer says right before he kills.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:35.330
Or is it get in the van?

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:35.830
No.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.470
It&#x27;s I have some business to attend to.

00:12:37.470 --> 00:13:05.728
Well, at least it&#x27;s over.

00:13:24.416 --> 00:13:25.150
Can I help you?

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.770
I thought I heard you downstairs.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:28.224
Nope.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.180
Been here the whole time.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.660
Just reading the paper.

00:13:39.584 --> 00:13:40.490
Mr. Dave Snooze.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.650
Can I bring you some tea?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.170
That sounds lovely.

00:14:10.656 --> 00:14:11.310
What could be in here?

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.250
Bodies?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:13.670
Torture machines?

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.290
Why do I want to go in there?

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:18.080
Because I was told not to and I have a problem with authority.

00:14:26.368 --> 00:14:27.200
I got your Chinese food.

00:14:28.608 --> 00:14:28.990
Lola?

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:30.752
Lola?

00:14:35.584 --> 00:14:36.220
What is that?

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:37.880
It&#x27;s a stair lift.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:41.760
I felt so bad that you were having to carry me up and down so I had one installed while

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:42.180
you were gone.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:43.780
It&#x27;s top of the line.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:44.780
That&#x27;s why it&#x27;s so quiet.

00:14:46.464 --> 00:14:47.000
Almost there.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.088
Here I go.

00:14:50.336 --> 00:14:52.928
Just a few more steps.

00:14:58.752 --> 00:14:59.168
Almost there.

00:15:01.216 --> 00:15:01.536
Here I go.

00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:07.900
Your Chinese food.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.140
That&#x27;s not Chinese food.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:13.240
Chinese food&#x27;s flat and round with cheese and tomato sauce and a bunch of different

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:13.660
toppings.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:14.940
That&#x27;s called pizza.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:15.860
Well, I don&#x27;t know.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:16.780
I don&#x27;t speak Chinese.

00:15:21.568 --> 00:15:22.790
I think I have to pee again.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:23.630
Okay.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:24.832
Here we go.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.632
Then you leave me no choice.

00:16:21.344 --> 00:16:22.688
I mean, I probably do, but I don&#x27;t want...

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:27.940
What&#x27;s your birthday?

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:29.056
Say what?

00:16:33.696 --> 00:16:37.460
No, it&#x27;s early, but you said you knew my secret, so I hope you like it.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.700
A collage made out of assorted photos of me?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:44.000
What on earth would possess you to make something this creepy?

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.440
Uh, because that&#x27;s what you specifically told me you wanted for your birthday?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.760
You sent me the photos.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.960
So you don&#x27;t want to murder me?

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.780
Why would I want to murder you?

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.380
Only a murderer would ask that question.

00:17:24.992 --> 00:17:25.200
Speedy?

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.079
What did you do to Speedy?

00:17:30.784 --> 00:17:32.512
Look who&#x27;s got a wallet and keys now, chubby!

00:19:10.144 --> 00:19:13.370
Hey, Pinky was planning to throw this on your actual birthday, but he called and said

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:16.210
we&#x27;d have to do it tonight because you were getting suspicious.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.790
You&#x27;re lucky to have such a nice friend.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:20.530
Nice friend?

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.136
Or the suburban strangler?

00:19:25.184 --> 00:19:25.696
Que, que?

00:19:27.104 --> 00:19:28.040
You&#x27;re not the suburban strangler?

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.700
He trapped me in his home.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:31.820
He locked the door so I couldn&#x27;t escape.

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:32.480
What?

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.360
The door wasn&#x27;t locked.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:38.440
Well, then, how come I couldn&#x27;t just open it like this?

00:19:43.584 --> 00:19:41.184
No.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.100
Just pull it, man.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.360
It&#x27;s not that heavy.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.220
Kids use it all the time.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:49.000
Little kids.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:50.260
Oh, no!

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:50.560
Oh!

00:19:54.176 --> 00:19:54.940
It doesn&#x27;t matter.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:20:00.360
What does matter is that you cut the phone line so I couldn&#x27;t call for help.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.560
Are you talking about the phone in the guest room?

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:03.680
It&#x27;s an antique.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.660
It&#x27;s just for decoration.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:08.840
Then how do you explain the blood on your hands?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.576
This is paint for the banner I made for your party.

00:20:15.648 --> 00:20:22.730
You may have all these people fooled, but I saw you murder a woman.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:23.390
What?

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:26.110
With a chainsaw!

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:29.950
That was an ice sculpture of you.

00:20:35.552 --> 00:20:36.230
What&#x27;s going on?

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:38.410
That&#x27;s the surprise party.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.290
I thought that was supposed to be next week.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:41.630
Ugh.

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.990
We interrupt this program with a special alert.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.630
The Suburban Strangler has been captured.

00:20:53.536 --> 00:20:55.350
You gotta admit there&#x27;s a strong resemblance.

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.576
Am I right?

00:21:02.496 --> 00:21:03.968
If anyone&#x27;s gonna murder you, it&#x27;s me.

00:21:05.152 --> 00:21:05.888
What&#x27;s that thing?

00:21:07.808 --> 00:21:08.270
Don&#x27;t worry.

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:09.248
I&#x27;m getting rid of it.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.740
I got your pizza.

00:21:14.112 --> 00:21:14.630
What is this?

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:17.350
I didn&#x27;t know when you&#x27;d be back, so I ordered Chinese food.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:17.984
You want some?

00:21:19.456 --> 00:21:17.984
Mmm.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:20.340
Mmm.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.460
You can really taste the Kung Pao.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:23.600
It&#x27;s strong.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:24.260
Mmm.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:25.380
Mmm.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.480
Oh no, you&#x27;re not getting rid of this.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.952
I&#x27;m never walking upstairs again.

00:22:06.688 --> 00:22:07.800
I still think Porky&#x27;s a murderer.

00:22:11.339 --> 00:22:08.096
Mmm.

